# Base packages that Arch Linux ARM does not build, but that do have an AUR
# PKGBUILD that builds on aarch64.
#
# Format: <package name> [aur package name if it differs]
# Installed with omarchy-pkg-aur-add, which means makepkg compiles them on the
# machine. On a Raspberry Pi that is slow; install.sh reports the list before
# starting so it can be skipped with --no-aur.

aether
cliamp
herdr
tensaku
localsend
mise-bin
tzupdate
ufw-docker
xdg-terminal-exec
yaru-icon-theme
ttf-ia-writer
